        "created_at": "2015-01-20T14:33:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>![](upload://l1MMla63MCJlCewIYsaArh2tOMW.gif)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Heh, yeah, it is.&nbsp;![](upload://yAzYZfnM0qCm5VromiIdGFhrJPJ.gif)&nbsp;(Seriously, hairless and huge nose - pretty much me. ![](upload://te1Dia3L3reTdctnfGJeHwvcS22.gif))&nbsp;I just wasn't sure that was the image you meant.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I don't know if I'm allowed to say anything on that, specifically, but I don't think anyone would mind if I say that the game pictured isn't related to the final SotM set.</p><p>Not to say they won't do something off-the-wall with the last set, just that this has nothing to do with it.</p>",
