        "id": 128080,
        "name": "grysqrl",
        "username": "grysqrl",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/grysqrl/{size}/1909_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-20T17:59:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We're being told that the next Oversized Villains pack will have a card for all villains</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Not exactly, the oversized villains pack will have a card for all villains who do not come with an oversized card. Thus, there may be new villains, but they will have an oversized card by default (or possibly some arrangement that doesn't involve a character card at all, though I find that less likely).</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If no new hero decks are coming, no new villain decks are coming, and the last expansion provides a new play style…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The final expansion will be 10 new environments. Environmental Vengeance style games pit the heroes against 2 x (H) environments and you see how long they can survive.</p>",
