        "created_at": "2015-01-20T20:35:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If we got any unreleased villains in the oversized pack I would be surprised. Everything changes in playtesting. Even the villain’s subtitle on either side of their character card can go through one or two changes.</p>",
