      {
        "id": 128083,
        "name": "TheSoundOfTrees",
        "username": "TheSoundOfTrees",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/da6949/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-21T01:30:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think that it just means that if any new villain appears, the oversized card will be included.</p><p>As for the last expansion : the \"cosmic menace\" is so big that it can't be fought directly, mano a mano, like other villains. Heroes will have to accomplish \"quests\" to neutralize it, some of these could be fight against the Villains we already know and, hum, love. Maybe with some cube handling. SotM : the strategy game. I am allowed to dream, right ?</p>",
